[00:07.578]Almost heaven, West Virginia
{"西弗吉尼亚 宛若天堂"}
[00:12.952]Blue Ridge Mountains, Shenandoah River
{"蓝岭山脉 仙纳度河"}
[00:19.275]Life is old there, older than the trees
{"古老的生命 比树木更悠长"}
[00:24.401]Younger than the mountains, blowing like the breeze
{"比群山年轻 如微风般徜徉"}
[00:29.347]
[00:29.450]Country roads, take me home
{"乡村路 带我回家"}
[00:35.304]To the place I belong
{"回到我眷恋的故乡"}
[00:41.233]West Virginia, mountain mama
{"西弗吉尼亚 山峦母亲"}
[00:47.100]Take me home, country roads
{"乡村路 带我回家"}
[00:52.665]
[00:54.244]All my memories, gather 'round her
{"所有记忆 围绕着她"}
[01:00.229]Miner's lady, stranger to blue water
{"矿工的妻子 从未见过海洋"}
[01:06.008]Dark and dusty, painted on the sky
{"昏暗与尘灰 涂抹在天上"}
[01:11.170]Misty taste of moonshine, teardrops in my eyes
{"月光似薄雾 泪光泛眼眶"}
[01:15.979]
[01:16.305]Country roads, take me home
{"乡村路 带我回家"}
[01:22.183]To the place I belong
{"回到我眷恋的故乡"}
[01:28.067]West Virginia, mountain mama
{"西弗吉尼亚 山峦母亲"}
[01:33.913]Take me home, country roads
{"乡村路 带我回家"}
[01:39.367]
[01:40.845]I hear her voice, in the morning hour she calls me
{"清晨时分 我听见她的呼唤"}
[01:46.329]The radio reminds me of my home, far away
{"收音机让我想起遥远的家乡"}
[01:52.111]Driving down the road I get a feeling
{"沿着公路行驶 心潮涌动"}
[01:55.827]That I should've been home yesterday, yesterday
{"昨日就该回到家乡 昨日就该"}
[02:02.937]
[02:03.163]Country roads, take me home
{"乡村路 带我回家"}
[02:09.025]To the place I belong
{"回到我眷恋的故乡"}
